  "root_problem": "Billing dispute tickets roughly doubled from ~600/month (Jun-Jul) to ~1200+/month (Aug-Sep 2026) (E-01) because the BV-17 high-consumption billing-import validation rule, deployed 2026-08-01 without unit scaling (E-14), misreads the raw register values of firmware-v4.2 AMI meters (which report in 0.1 m3 units since their 2026-06 rollout, E-13) as roughly 10x true consumption, wrongly rejecting valid AMI reads at billing import (1184 of the 1240 disputed ESTIMATED-read accounts, E-12) and forcing those accounts onto disputed estimated bills instead of their accepted actual reads."
 },
